From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:49:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] One file for a server mod's content and code

A server mod may list capability registries: its .hmod carries assets/ and
data/ next to mod.wasm. elevator-one packs ElevatorMod's blocks and code in
one elevatorid.hmod (12 scripts pass); docs/mods.md says how.
